<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>Humanitarian value: dignity under pressure</h2>
      <p><b>A humanitarian reading</b> begins by refusing to confuse constrained choice with moral failure.</p>
      <grid vertical-sizing="fill" spacing="small">
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
          <p role="eyebrow">Attention</p>
          <h3>Intelligence and feeling</h3>
          <p>The poem sustains attention to Kiều’s perception, talent, emotion, and pain.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
          <p role="eyebrow">Exposure</p>
          <h3>Sacrifice under demand</h3>
          <p>Her sacrifice invites compassion while exposing the conditions that require it.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
          <p role="eyebrow">Limit</p>
          <h3>Talent without shelter</h3>
          <p>Artistic gift and moral intelligence offer no protection from exploitation.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
          <p role="eyebrow">Aftermath</p>
          <h3>Survival without erasure</h3>
          <p>Rescue and reunion matter, but they do not cancel accumulated harm.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>